*   cannot be created without one (owner's rule), and the Windows user is made
*   BEFORE the password is asked for, so refusing has to take it back.
deffun delete_user(uname) calling '!delete_user'
* 28 Aug 26 Windows port - for the refusal below.  PRE_RELEASE_FIXES.md 36.
deffun profile_dir(uname) calling '!profile_dir'
deffun valid_os_name(name) calling '!valid_os_name'
deffun valid_os_path(path) calling '!valid_os_path'
deffun ps_script(script) calling '!ps_script'

   prompt ''

* rev 0.9.0 create-account requires admin priv, are we admin?
   if not(kernel(K$ADMINISTRATOR, -1)) then
      stop sysmsg(2001)  ;* Command requires administrator privileges
   end
      
* we run as root, and the root umask is usually 022, that will not work for us
   if umask(002) then null

   parser = "!PARSER"
   no.query = @false
   make.admin = @false
